{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test1.png?t=1745407493\" /><strong></strong><br> <br><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test3.png?t=1745407493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage the cosmic plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bigger your domino web, the more vulnerable you become. Each turn the plane changes so you will have to improvise to win.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test7.png?t=1745407493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test8.png?t=1745407493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test9.png?t=1745407493\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic board elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the cosmic elements have an effect on eachother. Fire, explosives, ice, electricity, darkness, water and more. This makes every new playthrough dynamic and different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 upgradable domino pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 unique Nova Cards that alter the game significantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unlockable decks with each their own difficulty level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 unlockable challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily playthroughs with leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive visual effects that will make you want to come back over and over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3399130?t=1745407493","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745407493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/7b186e3333f46c00a7a6e9a13930a8fec2f9fe42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745407493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/7b186e3333f46c00a7a6e9a13930a8fec2f9fe42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745407493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/test1.png?t=1745407493\" /><strong></strong><br> <br><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras